{"c":[{"name":"20261005T182018Z-0c929a2ce63bdaff","text":"H8 VM: the rig guest is 960x600 pt; a centred caret-fixture executor window leaves every event-card spot covering a field (noClearSpot): move it to x=0 (fixture-ax move). seed-user-tcc.sh restarts tccd: running it while a TCC prompt is up shows the prompt twice.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T182018Z-327bc9cdd4327c33","text":"H8: an XML comment in an .entitlements file must not contain '--' (AMFIUnserializeXML refuses it and codesign fails). The event card's done line takes ⌘Z only after a verified step; the helper reports written:0 for calendar adds.","type":"note"}]}
